CronManager-on-Rust
Copyright 2026 Rainer Türner

This product is a Rust reimplementation of CronManager, originally
developed at the Information System Authority of Estonia
(Riigi Infosüsteemi Amet, RIA) as part of the Bürokratt project
(https://github.com/buerokratt/CronManager).

Portions of the domain design, YAML DSL, and REST surface are
faithful reproductions of the original JVM implementation and
carry its Apache-2.0 heritage.
